# Added 22 Oct 2026 (SCRUM-60), approved by Attila Madarasz.
# Go 1.26.10 / 1.27.3 (20 Oct 2026) add a fixed denylist of eight intermediate CA keys to
# crypto/x509. Caddy in caddy:2-alpine is still built with Go 1.26.8, so Trivy flags stdlib.
# Same expiry as the block above; the same Go >= 1.26.10 Caddy build clears it.
CVE-2026-111943 exp:2026-11-02

# Added 28 Oct 2026 (SCRUM-33 PR, site #47), approved by Attila Madarasz.
# github.com/go-jose/go-jose/v4 v4.1.5 in Caddy: denial of service when parsing JWKs with RSA
# keys, fixed in 4.1.6. Caddy parses JWKs for ACME certificates; the site's Caddy does no TLS
# (plain HTTP behind the gateway, admin API off), so it never takes that path. Same expiry as
# the blocks above; remove it with them once a fixed Caddy image is out.
CVE-2026-116587 exp:2026-11-02
